Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 13:50:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs: update AGENT.md for ADR-0003 through ADR-0005

AGENT.md hadn't been touched since ADR-0002 and had drifted well behind
the codebase:

- Section 2/7: flat humidity_threshold no longer exists (ADR-0004);
  YAML must read the published session/delta/baseline entities instead
  of recomputing state.
- Section 4: documents _publish_decision_state (the three
  hass.states.async_set() calls) alongside _call_actuator, and the
  presence tracking (last_presence_at, confirmation window) added by
  ADR-0003/ADR-0005.
- Section 6: adds the test_actuator_integration.py mapping and the
  FakeStates helper; notes the STATE_UNKNOWN stub some tests need.
- Section 8: ADR table extended through ADR-0005 (was stuck at
  ADR-0001/ADR-0002), with an explicit reminder to verify against
  adr/ and git log rather than trusting a stale table.
- Section 5/9: notes on the removed humidity_threshold key and the
  try/except scope for state-publishing vs. service calls.
